msgid "Part deleted · Ctrl+Z to undo"
msgstr "부품 삭제됨 · Ctrl+Z 되돌리기"

msgid "Transform confirmed · Ctrl+Z to undo"
msgstr "변환 확정 · Ctrl+Z 되돌리기"

